    "body": "This is expected behavior added by the optimizations added to v75 \nThere is no need to rollback, before it waited for the server longer\n\nNow it's your browser's job to do some computation, since there have been so much feedback on server performance and ram usage I made the decision to show a skeleton while the page is still loading\n\nThe v2 beta uses a different system again, feel free to try it out and let me know if that works better for you",
